cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BodyClocks in your research, please cite this software using the metadata below."
title: "BodyClocks"
abstract: >-
  BodyClocks is an R Shiny application for exploring circadian transcriptomic
  datasets from mouse and baboon, including rhythmicity statistics, temporal
  expression profiles, functional enrichment, STRING protein-association
  networks, and dataset comparisons.
authors:
  - family-names: "Dudek"
    given-names: "Michal"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-07-15
repository-code: "https://github.com/Michal0110/BodyClocks_app"
url: "https://www.bodyclocks.org"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - circadian rhythms
  - transcriptomics
  - gene expression
  - functional enrichment
  - protein association networks
  - R Shiny
